  "historyNote": "#5911, eff 10-14-94; ss and moved by #7410, eff 11-23-00 (from Rev 402.02); (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08; ss by #12027, eff 10-28-16; ss by #13943-B, eff 4-27-24",
